    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like \"healing\" or \"new layers\" or anything like that. it just feels hollow. like there's literally nothing left inside me. i spend all day just staring at the walls, waiting for a schedule that isn't coming anymore. i used to have a purpose, even if it was exhausting. now i'm just an extra in a movie that's already finished. how am i supposed to just... start again? it feels impossible.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
