      "content": "Please know that yes, pain often feels this sharp and all-consuming now, but it has a way of eventually flowing into a more manageable space, even while you feel stuck. Healing isn't about suddenly finding life again or filling the void with great joy; sometimes it just means the constant gnawing ache softens enough to let small things happen again over time. Your worth was never tied to taking care of him, and your presence matters even when you can't see why you're still here because the answer will come in its own time.",
